VISUALINTELLIGENCED(8)      System Manager's Manual     VISUALINTELLIGENCED(8)

NAME
     visualintelligenced – visualintelligenced - VisualIntelligence

SYNOPSIS
         visualintelligenced takes no arguments, and users should not launch
     it manually.

DESCRIPTION
         visualintelligenced is the system daemon backing VisualIntelligence
     features.

HISTORY
         visualintelligenced first appeared in macOS 27.

